				<title>布娃娃物理新游《Off the Shelf!》正式发售，不到3美元冲榜</title>
				<link>https://info.steamhunter.link/posts/2026-10-22-3584250-9f27b192/</link>
				<pubDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 04:02:02 +0800</pubDate>
